            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示菜单栏各项目的图像。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顯示選單列各項目的影像。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Display the icon as a monochrome image that dynamically adjusts to match the menu bar's appearance. This setting removes all color from the icon, but ensures consistent rendering with both light and dark backgrounds.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Symbol wird einfarbig dargestellt und passt sich der Menüleiste an. Farben werden entfernt, damit es auf hellen und dunklen Hintergründen einheitlich erscheint."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Display the icon as a monochrome image that dynamically adjusts to match the menu bar's appearance. This setting removes all color from the icon, but ensures consistent rendering with both light and dark backgrounds."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muestra el icono en monocromo y lo adapta a la barra. Elimina sus colores para que se vea de forma uniforme en fondos claros y oscuros."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Affiche l’icône en monochrome et l’adapte à la barre. Les couleurs sont supprimées pour un rendu cohérent sur les fonds clairs et sombres."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アイコンを単色で表示し、メニューバーの外観に合わせて調整します。色は失われますが、明暗の背景で一貫した表示になります。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "아이콘을 메뉴 막대 모양에 맞게 조절되는 단색으로 표시합니다. 색상이 제거되지만 밝고 어두운 배경에서 일관되게 표시됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mostra o ícone em monocromia e o adapta à barra. Remove as cores para manter a exibição consistente em fundos claros e escuros."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以单色显示图标并自动适应菜单栏外观。此设置会去除图标颜色，确保浅色和深色背景下显示一致。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以單色顯示圖像並自動適應選單列外觀。此設定會移除圖像顏色，確保淺色和深色背景下顯示一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
