    "Item unavailable. Show it in the menu bar, then drag again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Element nicht verfügbar. Zeige es in der Menüleiste an und ziehe erneut."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Item unavailable. Show it in the menu bar, then drag again."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elemento no disponible. Muéstralo en la barra de menús y arrastra de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Élément indisponible. Affichez-le dans la barre des menus, puis réessayez."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "項目を取得できません。メニューバーに表示してから再度ドラッグしてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "항목을 사용할 수 없습니다. 메뉴 막대에 표시한 후 다시 드래그하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Item indisponível. Mostre-o na barra de menus e arraste novamente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目不可用。请先让它显示在菜单栏，再次拖动。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "項目無法使用。請先讓它顯示在選單列，再次拖移。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Items are shown from left to right. Saved experimental sections do not control macOS overflow.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Elemente werden von links nach rechts angezeigt. Gespeicherte experimentelle Bereiche steuern den macOS-Überlauf nicht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Items are shown from left to right. Saved experimental sections do not control macOS overflow."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los elementos se muestran de izquierda a derecha. Las secciones experimentales guardadas no controlan el desbordamiento de macOS."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les éléments sont affichés de gauche à droite. Les sections expérimentales enregistrées ne contrôlent pas le débordement de macOS."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "項目は左から右へ表示されます。保存した実験用セクションは macOS のオーバーフローを制御しません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "항목은 왼쪽에서 오른쪽 순서입니다. 저장된 실험용 구역은 macOS 오버플로를 제어하지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Os itens são exibidos da esquerda para a direita. As seções experimentais salvas não controlam o transbordamento do macOS."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "项目按从左到右排列。已保存的实验分区不控制 macOS 溢出。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "項目由左至右排列。已儲存的實驗分區不控制 macOS 溢出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Items can also be arranged by ⌘ Command + dragging them in the menu bar.": {
