    "Some applications may have changed. Use Show to restore owned changes before editing the selection. The recovery record is kept; no operation was replayed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Some applications may have changed. Use Show to restore owned changes before editing the selection. The recovery record is kept; no operation was replayed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "部分应用可能已更改。请先点击“显示”恢复 FloeBar 的更改，再编辑选择。恢复记录已保留，未重复执行操作。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "部分應用程式可能已變更。請先按「顯示」還原 FloeBar 的變更，再編輯選擇。復原記錄已保留，未重複執行操作。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一部のアプリが変更された可能性があります。「表示」で FloeBar の変更を復元してから選択を変更してください。復元記録は保持され、操作は再実行されていません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "일부 앱이 변경되었을 수 있습니다. 선택을 변경하기 전에 표시를 눌러 FloeBar의 변경 사항을 복원하세요. 복구 기록은 유지되며 작업은 반복되지 않았습니다."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einige Apps wurden möglicherweise geändert. Klicke vor dem Ändern der Auswahl auf „Einblenden“, um FloeBar-Änderungen zurückzusetzen. Der Wiederherstellungseintrag bleibt erhalten; keine Aktion wurde wiederholt."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Certaines apps ont pu changer. Utilisez Afficher pour annuler les modifications de FloeBar avant de modifier la sélection. Le journal de restauration est conservé ; aucune action n’a été répétée."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Algunas apps pueden haber cambiado. Usa Mostrar para restaurar los cambios de FloeBar antes de editar la selección. El registro de recuperación se conserva; no se repitió ninguna operación."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alguns apps podem ter mudado. Use Mostrar para restaurar as alterações do FloeBar antes de editar a seleção. O registro de recuperação foi mantido; nenhuma operação foi repetida."
          }
        }
      }
    },
